{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mike\u2019s Hidden Basement</strong> is a linear first-person puzzle platformer featuring 5 unique levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins in the seemingly harmless basement of your home quickly turns into a nightmarish descent into a surreal underground world filled with strange architecture, enemies, and dangerous mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person platforming with jumping and timing challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various puzzle elements: switches, labyrinths, moving platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies like zombies that block your path or chase you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising lava that forces quick thinking and fast movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal world that changes with every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact but intense gameplay experience: approx. 1\u20132 hours</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 fully playable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language: English &amp; German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No internet connection or account required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned update to improve UI and user experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616540?t=1772605917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616540/a7eb578146d62530d4af9f242ab52ec9e5a0cbc4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772605917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616540/ebd271a81764d56c3b49d75b2d39b1bf11132b76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772605917",